stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING_SEND
    PENDING_SEND --> PENDING_EXCHANGE_OPEN : orden enviada
    PENDING_EXCHANGE_OPEN --> ENTRY_FILLED_AWAITING_POSITION_SYNC : fill recibido
    ENTRY_FILLED_AWAITING_POSITION_SYNC --> SAFE_CHECK : reconciliar amount
    state SAFE_CHECK {
        [*] --> RECONCILE : filtro cantidad
        RECONCILE --> HARD_SL_ATTEMPT : exposición real
        HARD_SL_ATTEMPT --> HARD_SL_OK : ACK válido
        HARD_SL_ATTEMPT --> EMERGENCY_CLOSE : ACK falló/ambiguo
        RECONCILE --> NO_POSITION : exposición cero
        NO_POSITION --> OPEN : persistir amount=None
        HARD_SL_OK --> OPEN
        EMERGENCY_CLOSE --> HALT
    }
    state OPEN {
        [*] --> CLOSING_INITIATED : salida normal
        CLOSING_INITIATED --> CLOSING_AWAITING_FILL : orden enviada
        CLOSING_AWAITING_FILL --> [*] : fill confirmado
    }
    OPEN --> HALT : estado ambiguo / persistencia
    HALT --> [*] : recovery manual
    note right of SAFE_CHECK
      Fail-safe REAL:
      - Cero/malformed → reconciliar
      - Exposición sin HARD SL válido → Emergency Close + HALT
      - amount=None + estado ambiguo → persistir + HALT
    end note
